WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.701 --> 00:00:02.400
-Hey, hey!

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.601
I want to remind everybody,
"5 More Sleeps"

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:05.934
the animated special...

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:07.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.834
"5 More Sleeps 'Til Christmas"

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:11.434
airs next Friday, December 23rd,
at 8:30 p.m.,

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:13.100
after "The Grinch" on NBC.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.934
Check it out, get cozy
with your family.

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:17.100
Cozy up around the tree,
enjoy "5 More Sleeps."

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.434
And if you want a little
something before then,

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:19.767
I went out under

00:00:19.767 --> 00:00:21.601
the Rockefeller Center
Christmas tree earlier tonight

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:24.100
and I videotaped myself
reading the book.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.100
Or videoed myself.
I guess I didn't videotape it.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.934
-Sure.
-I videoed myself

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:30.267
reading the book
in virtual reality 360.

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:32.934
So if you have the YouTube app,
if you have a VR headset,

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:34.934
if you have an Oculus,

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.133
go search for Jimmy Fallon's
"5 More Sleeps."

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:38.467
You'll see it.
You look at the tree.

00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:40.133
You can look at me.
It's pretty bizarre. It's fun.

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.801
It's not the metaverse,
but it's New York City.

00:00:41.801 --> 00:00:42.968
That's all.
[ Cheers and applause ]

